<style>
    @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
    .page {
        width: 794px; height: 1123px;
        padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
        position: relative;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
    }
    .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    td { padding: 5px 0; }
    .form-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 100px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <div>
            <p>University of Central Missouri</p>
            <p>Office of Student Financial Services</p>
            <p>P.O. Box 800</p>
            <p>Warrensburg, MO 64093-5178</p>
            <p>Phone: {{ contact_phone }}</p>
            <p>FAX: {{ contact_fax }}</p>
            <p>Webpage: <a href="{{ website_url }}">{{ website_url }}</a></p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>UCM use only</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Request to Receive Financial Aid for Faculty-Led Tour - Domestic</h1>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <p>2020/2021</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div>
            <p>To: Center for Global Education</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>STUDAB</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>From: <span data-field="applicant.full_name">{{ applicant.full_name }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <p>Please accept this request for additional financial aid to help pay the educational and living expenses I'll incur to participate in an <span data-field="program_type">{{ program_type }}</span> program of study within the United States. I have filed/will file the Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) for the 2020/2021 school year:</p>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <label>Yes</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="fafsa_yes">
        <label>No</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="fafsa_no">
    </div>

    <p>Please note: completion of this form is not a guarantee of increased financial assistance.</p>

    <table style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Course Name and Number:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 80%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Location:</td>
            <td class="form-field"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Program Title/Description:</td>
            <td class="form-field"></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div>
            <p>Beginning date of program:</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>Ending date:</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <table style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Enrollment term for tour:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 15%;">Fall 2020</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 15%;">Spring 2021</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 15%;">Summer 2021</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p><em>*For summer enrollment, you will also need to submit UCM's Summer Financial Aid Request, available on MyCentral on or around March 1, 2021.</em></p>

    <p>Is this program sponsored by the UCM Office of International Programs? <span data-field="sponsored_yes">{{ sponsored_yes }}</span> Yes <span data-field="sponsored_no">{{ sponsored_no }}</span> No</p>

    <p>Following are the total estimated expenses I expect to incur to participate in this program:</p>

    <table style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td>Tuition and Fees:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Application and other required Program Fees:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Room (Housing):</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Board (Meals):</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Books and Supplies:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Transportation:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Personal Expenses:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Other:</td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Total</strong></td>
            <td class="form-field" style="width: 100%;"></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
        <p>Please proceed to page 2 ...</p>
        <button style="padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid #000;">Reset Expenses</button>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>Page 2 – Request to Receive Financial Aid for Faculty-Led Tour - Domestic</p>
        <p>2020/2021</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>Student's Last Name: _________________________ UCM ID#: <span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Student Statement (Required)</h2>

    <p>Following is the primary reason(s) I wish to participate in a program of study within the United States (continue on a separate page, if necessary):</p>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 250px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <!-- Large text area for statement -->
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <div>
            <p>Student's Signature</p>
            <div class="form-field" style="width: 60%;" data-field="student_s_signature">{{ student_s_signature }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>Date</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <p>Before submitting this document to the Office of Student Financial Services, you must obtain the following approval.</p>
    </div>

    <p>I approve of this student's plan to participate in a faculty-led tour within the United States. The student intends to complete and earn <span data-field="credit_hours">{{ credit_hours }}</span> credit hours, all of which will apply toward completion of his/her UCM degree requirements. I believe this program of study represents a valuable and complementary academic opportunity for this student.</p>

    <p>Comments/Clarification:</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 100px; margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <!-- Smaller text area for comments -->
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <div>
            <p>Signature of Study Abroad Coordinator</p>
            <div class="form-field" style="width: 60%;" data-field="signature_of_study_abroad_coordinator">{{ signature_of_study_abroad_coordinator }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>Date</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>After completing this request, obtain approval from the Study Abroad Coordinator. After approval, submit this document to the UCM Office of Student Financial Services in person (1100 Ward Edwards Bldg.) or by mail (Student Financial Services, P.O. Box 800, Warrensburg, MO 64093-5178), or by fax (660-543-8080).</p>
</div>